oyment troubleshooting. For device enrollment, see EST diagnostics."},"2352":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Check"},"2353":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"What to inspect"},"2354":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Next step"},"2355":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"CA"},"2356":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Exists, is active and has usable dates."},"2357":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Authorities."},"2358":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Key"},"2359":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"The record has a usable private key and the engine can sign."},"2360":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Try **Sign / Verify** in KMS; check provider permissions and availability."},"2361":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"CSR"},"2362":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Correct PEM and verifiable signature."},"2363":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"`openssl req -in request.csr -noout -verify -text`."},"2364":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Profile"},"2365":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Selected source, existing ID, allowed algorithm and size."},"2366":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Check Profiles precedence; CA and DMS resolve differently."},"2367":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Result"},"2368":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Appropriate subject, SAN, usages and dates."},"2369":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Compare CSR, profile and certificate; successful issuance does not establish consumer acceptance."},"2370":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"For unexpected certificate fields, review `Honor Subject`, `Honor Key Usage`, `Honor Extended Key Usages` and `Honor Extensions`. The latter preserves SAN only, without validating entitlement to those names. Validity is not automatically clamped to CA expiration."},"2371":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"For CA reissuance failures, check revocation and date: reissuance is not supported for a revoked or already expired CA. To change its key, use Hierarchy and rotation."},"2372":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"Check each boundary independently:"},"2373":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**Record:** read the correct certificate again by serial and issuer. Confirm status, reason and time; expired or permanently revoked records reject further transitions."},"2374":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**Endpoint:** inspect AIA and CDP. Query those URLs from the consumer’s network; an old route or incorrect issuer can explain a discrepancy."},"2375":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**OCSP:** save a fresh response, verify signature and timestamps, and observe status. An HTTP error for an absent serial does not mean `Good` or guarantee a signed `Unknown`."},"2376":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**CRL:** compare `latest_crl`, number and timestamps with the downloaded list. Check the serial in its contents. If unchanged, review `regenerate_on_revoke`, event delivery, jobs, signing and storage with the deployment operator."},"2377":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**Client:** check cache, policy for expired or unavailable evidence, critical IDP extension and rejection of a new connection."},"2378":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"Reactivation from `CertificateHold` needs a new CRL for the client to stop seeing the hold. Reactivating a CA does not restore its descendant cascade; inspect every status and individual operation failure."},"2379":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#the-chain-validates-but-the-connection-fails","content":"Check expected identity, SAN, KU/EKU, matching key, presented intermediates and consumer permissions. Distinguish server TLS trust, client authentication and action authorization. Follow Validation for positive and rejection tests."},"2380":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/pki/troubleshooting#the-chain-validates-but-the-connection-fails","content":"When escalating a problem, provide identifiers, error and relevant public evidence, including query timestamps and version. This distinguishes issuance, publication and consumer application failures."}},"count":2380},"sorting":{"language":"english","sor