etworking-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#bare-metal-con-metallb-o-kube-vip","content":"Bare metal con MetalLB o kube-vip"},"250":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-externo-nat-o-vpn","content":"Proxy externo, NAT o VPN"},"251":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"¿Qué ocurre si necesitas tres Gateways?"},"252":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Guía de decisión"},"253":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Verifica la ruta de tráfico"},"254":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"El chart de Lamassu crea un Gateway compartido con listeners HTTP y HTTPS. Envoy Gateway crea normalmente un deployment de proxy dedicado y un Service `LoadBalancer`."},"255":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"La accesibilidad externa depende de toda la ruta. Un recurso `Gateway` no configura por sí mismo el router, firewall, DNS, balanceador cloud ni NAT upstream."},"256":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Normalmente no. Si lo omites, el controlador del Gateway y la implementación del balanceador pueden asignar una dirección y publicarla en `Gateway.status.addresses` y en el estado del Service generado."},"257":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Defínelo únicamente cuando:"},"258":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"tu balanceador cloud o bare metal permite solicitar una dirección concreta"},"259":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"esa dirección está asignada a este Gateway"},"260":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/