pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management#inventario-de-claves","content":"**Aliases**: nombres alternativos asociados a la clave."},"2074":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management#inventario-de-claves","content":"**Tags**: etiquetas para clasificación y búsqueda."},"2075":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management#inventario-de-claves","content":"**Related Entities**: certificados u otras entidades vinculadas a esa clave."},"2076":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management#inventario-de-claves","content":"Desde esta vista también se accede a las acciones más habituales:"},"2077":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management#inventario-de-claves","content":"**View Details** para consultar metadatos, identificadores y relaciones."},"2078":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management#inventario-de-claves","content":"**Generate CSR** para crear una solicitud PKCS#10 con la clave seleccionada."},"2079":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/